{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"튜토리얼","generated":true,"anchor":"튜토리얼","identifiers":["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-0-Project-Setup","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-1-Mock-Hand","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-2-Pose-Features","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-3-Reference-Poses","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-4-Scoring-and-Coaching","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"40%EB%B6%84","text":"40분"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"예상 소요 시간"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"코드를 직접 따라 치는 기준입니다."}],"type":"small"}]},{"size":2,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"이 단계에서 만드는 파일","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"TutorView.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ARKit"},{"text":" · ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":") · "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JamoPicker.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" · "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VerdictCard.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" · "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ErrorChart.swift"},{"text":"(셋 다 ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"만). 화면 세 개는 SwiftUI 하나로 충분하고, "},{"code":"TutorView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"만 손 좌우 설정 때문에 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import ARKit"},{"type":"text","text":"이 더 필요합니다."}]}]}],"numberOfColumns":3},{"anchor":"51","level":3,"text":"5.1","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"자음 19자와 모음 21자를 표로 채웁니다. 손바닥 방향으로 갈리는 글자에는 표시를 남겨, 그 글자들만 수향에 더 큰 가중치를 줍니다.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Jamo.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — 수향으로 갈리는 글자","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true,"type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":6},{"line":6}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"}],"wrap":0,"code":["import Foundation","","enum Jamo: String, CaseIterable, Identifiable, Sendable {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 손 모양이 같고 손바닥 방향으로만 갈리는 자모.","    \/\/\/ 회전 정규화를 적용하면 이 글자들이 서로 뭉개진다.","    \/\/\/ 표준 손 모양은 국립국어원 한국수어사전에서 반드시 재확인할 것.","    static let orientationCritical: Set<Jamo> = [.ssangSiot, .o, .yo, .u, .yu, .eu, .i]","","    var isOrientationCritical: Bool { Jamo.orientationCritical.contains(self) }","}"],"showLineNumbers":false},{"anchor":"52","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"5.2"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"40자 전체와 비교해 가장 가까운 순으로 줄을 세웁니다. 40번의 비교는 사실상 공짜입니다 — 프레임당 1ms 예산 안에 충분히 들어갑니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PoseMatcher.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 40자를 한 번에 줄 세우기"}]},{"type":"codeListing","wrap":0,"lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}]},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}],"style":"highlight"}],"showLineNumbers":false,"copyToClipboard":true,"code":["import Foundation","import simd","","struct PoseMatcher: Sendable {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 40자 전체와 비교해 가장 가까운 순으로 돌려준다. 프레임당 1ms 예산 안에 든다.","    @MainActor","    func rank(_ feature: PoseFeature, in library: ReferenceLibrary) -> [PoseMatch] {","        library.all()","            .map { match(feature, to: $0.value, jamo: $0.key) }","            .sorted { $0.distance < $1.distance }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"53","text":"5.3"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"표를 채우면서 반드시 해야 할 일."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" 기준 표 안에서 서로 너무 가까운 자모 쌍을 자동으로 찾습니다. 거리가 1 미만인 쌍은 현재 표로는 갈라낼 수 없습니다. 이 목록에만 나중에 CoreML 보조 분류기를 붙이면 됩니다.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"⚠️ 자리표시자 표로는 갈라내지 못하는 쌍이 16개 나옵니다. 실측 포즈로 교체하면 줄어듭니다. 화면 위쪽에 그 개수가 항상 표시됩니다."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"warning","name":"Warning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — 서로 헷갈리는 쌍 찾기","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import Foundation","import simd","","@MainActor","final class ReferenceLibrary {","    \/\/ …","","    func confusablePairs(threshold: Float = 1, matcher: PoseMatcher = PoseMatcher())","        -> [(Jamo, Jamo, Float)] {","        if threshold == 1, let cached = confusableCache { return cached }","        let items = all().sorted { $0.key.rawValue < $1.key.rawValue }","        var out: [(Jamo, Jamo, Float)] = []","        for i in items.indices {","            for j in (i + 1)..<items.count {","                let d = matcher.match(items[i].value, to: items[j].value, jamo: items[j].key).distance","                if d < threshold { out.append((items[i].key, items[j].key, d)) }","            }","        }","        let sorted = out.sorted { $0.2 < $1.2 }","        if threshold == 1 { confusableCache = sorted }","        return sorted","    }","}"],"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}]},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}]},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}],"style":"highlight"}],"showLineNumbers":false},{"text":"5.4","anchor":"54","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"창 화면을 조립합니다. 자모 선택 · 판정 카드 · 오차 그래프 · 설정을 차례로 세우고, 아래 오너먼트에 몰입 공간을 여닫는 버튼을 답니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TutorView.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — 창 화면 조립","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}]},{"range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":25},{"line":25}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":26},{"line":26}]},{"range":[{"line":27},{"line":27}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":28},{"line":28}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":29},{"line":29}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":30},{"line":30}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":31},{"line":31}]},{"range":[{"line":32},{"line":32}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":33},{"line":33}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":34},{"line":34}],"style":"highlight"}],"code":["import ARKit","import SwiftUI","","struct TutorView: View {","    @Environment(TutorModel.self) private var model","    @Environment(\\.openImmersiveSpace) private var openSpace","    @Environment(\\.dismissImmersiveSpace) private var dismissSpace","    @State private var spaceOpen = false","","    var body: some View {","        @Bindable var model = model","","        NavigationStack {","            ScrollView {","                VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 28) {","                    header","                    JamoPicker(selection: $model.target)","                    VerdictCard()","                    ErrorChart()","                    settings","                }","                .padding(28)","            }","            .navigationTitle(\"지화 튜터\")","            .toolbar {","                ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomOrnament) {","                    Button(spaceOpen ? \"연습 끝내기\" : \"연습 시작\") {","                        Task { await toggleSpace() }","                    }","                    .buttonStyle(.borderedProminent)","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"5.5","anchor":"55"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"자음 19 · 모음 21 그리드입니다. 손바닥 방향으로 갈리는 글자에는 "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"점을 하나 찍어"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" 눈에 보이게 합니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"JamoPicker.swift","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — 40자 그리드","type":"text"}]},{"showLineNumbers":false,"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}]},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}]},{"range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}]},{"range":[{"line":25},{"line":25}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":26},{"line":26}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":27},{"line":27}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":28},{"line":28}]},{"range":[{"line":29},{"line":29}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":30},{"line":30}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":31},{"line":31}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":32},{"line":32}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":33},{"line":33}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":34},{"line":34}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":35},{"line":35}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":36},{"line":36}]}],"code":["import SwiftUI","","struct JamoPicker: View {","    @Binding var selection: Jamo","    \/\/ …","","    private func section(_ title: String, _ items: [Jamo]) -> some View {","        VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 8) {","            Text(title).font(.headline)","            LazyVGrid(columns: columns, spacing: 8) {","                ForEach(items) { jamo in","                    Button {","                        selection = jamo","                    } label: {","                        Text(jamo.rawValue)","                            .font(.title2)","                            .frame(maxWidth: .infinity, minHeight: 44)","                            .overlay(alignment: .topTrailing) {","                                if jamo.isOrientationCritical {","                                    Circle()","                                        .frame(width: 5, height: 5)","                                        .foregroundStyle(.tint)","                                        .padding(4)","                                }","                            }","                    }","                    .buttonStyle(.bordered)","                    .background(jamo == selection ? Color.accentColor.opacity(0.35) : .clear,","                                in: .rect(cornerRadius: 12))","                }","            }","            Text(\"점이 붙은 글자는 손바닥 방향으로 갈립니다. 회전 정규화를 적용하면 서로 구별할 수 없게 됩니다.\")","                .font(.caption2)","                .foregroundStyle(.secondary)","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"56","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"5.6"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"판정 카드입니다. 유지 시간이 링으로 차오르고 통과하면 초록으로 바뀝니다. 목표와 다른 글자에 더 가까우면 그것도 함께 알려 줍니다 — 어느 쪽으로 틀렸는지 아는 것이 학습에 도움이 됩니다. 그리고 4.5에서 만든 ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"약지·새끼 안내"}]},{"text":"가 여기에 붙습니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VerdictCard.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — 판정과 교정 문장","type":"text"}]},{"showLineNumbers":false,"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":25},{"line":25}]}],"code":["import SwiftUI","","struct VerdictCard: View {","    @Environment(TutorModel.self) private var model","","    var body: some View {","        GroupBox {","            HStack(alignment: .center, spacing: 24) {","                \/\/ … 유지 시간 링 …","","                VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 8) {","                    Text(headline)","                        .font(.title3.weight(.semibold))","                        .foregroundStyle(passed ? .green : .primary)","","                    if let advice = model.advice {","                        Label(advice, systemImage: \"hand.point.up.left\")","                            .font(.body)","                    }","","                    if let note = model.fingerNote, !passed {","                        Label(note, systemImage: \"hand.raised.fingers.spread\")","                            .font(.caption)","                            .foregroundStyle(.secondary)","                    }","","                    if let best = model.bestGuess, best.jamo != model.target, !passed {","                        Text(\"지금 손 모양은 ‘\\(best.jamo.rawValue)’에 더 가깝습니다.\")","                            .font(.caption)","                            .foregroundStyle(.secondary)","                    }","                }","                Spacer(minLength: 0)","            }","            .accessibilityElement(children: .combine)","            .accessibilityLabel(Text(headline + (model.advice.map { \". \" + $0 } ?? \"\")))","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"5.7","anchor":"57","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"손가락별 오차 막대에는 허용 오차선을 함께 그려 지금 어디쯤인지 눈으로 보이게 합니다. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"선의 위치는 손가락마다 다를 수 있습니다"}]},{"text":" — 약지·새끼를 관대하게 보는 글자에서는 그 두 줄의 선만 오른쪽으로 물러납니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ErrorChart.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 손가락별 허용 오차선"}]},{"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}]},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":37},{"line":37}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":43},{"line":43}],"style":"highlight"}],"code":["import SwiftUI","","struct ErrorChart: View {","    @Environment(TutorModel.self) private var model","    \/\/ …","","    private func row(_ finger: FingerName) -> some View {","        let degrees = worstDegrees(finger)","        let tolerance = toleranceDegrees(finger)","        let relaxed = tolerance > CGFloat(model.toleranceDegrees) + 0.5","        let over = degrees > tolerance","        return HStack(spacing: 12) {","            Text(finger.korean)","                .font(.callout)","                .frame(width: 44, alignment: .leading)","","            GeometryReader { geo in","                let full = geo.size.width","                let unit: CGFloat = full \/ 45.0     \/\/ 0…45도 눈금","                ZStack(alignment: .leading) {","                    Capsule().fill(.quaternary).frame(height: 10)","                    Capsule()","                        .fill(over ? Color.orange : Color.green)","                        .frame(width: min(degrees * unit, full), height: 10)","                    Rectangle()","                        .fill(.primary.opacity(0.5))","                        .frame(width: 1.5, height: 18)","                        .offset(x: tolerance * unit)","                }","            }","            .frame(height: 20)","","            Text(\"\\(Int(degrees))°\")","                .font(.caption.monospacedDigit())","                .frame(width: 40, alignment: .trailing)","","            Text(over ? \"초과\" : (relaxed ? \"완화\" : \"통과\"))","                .font(.caption2)","                .frame(width: 34)","                .foregroundStyle(over ? .orange : .secondary)","        }","        .accessibilityElement(children: .combine)","        .accessibilityLabel(\"\\(finger.korean) 오차 \\(Int(degrees))도, 허용 오차 \\(Int(tolerance))도, \\(over ? \"초과\" : \"통과\")\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"5.8","type":"heading","anchor":"58"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"색이 아니라 "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"길이와 형태","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"로 구분하고, 모든 판정에 접근성 레이블을 붙입니다. 청각장애 학습자가 주 사용자인 앱에서 소리로만 알려 주는 설계는 성립하지 않고, 색맹 사용자도 읽을 수 있어야 합니다. 허용 오차도 레이블에 함께 읽어 줍니다 — 화면에서 선의 위치로 보이던 정보가 소리로도 남아야 합니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ErrorChart.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — 손가락별 대표 오차와 허용 오차","type":"text"}]},{"showLineNumbers":false,"copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":6},{"line":6}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}],"style":"highlight"}],"code":["import SwiftUI","","struct ErrorChart: View {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 손가락마다 허용 오차가 다를 수 있다.","    \/\/\/ 약지와 새끼를 따로 접어야 하는 글자에서는 그 둘만 넓다.","    private func toleranceDegrees(_ finger: FingerName) -> CGFloat {","        guard let t = model.currentMatch?.bendTolerance,","              t.count == PoseFeature.bendCount else { return CGFloat(model.toleranceDegrees) }","        return CGFloat(t[finger.rawValue * 3] * 180 \/ .pi)","    }","","    \/\/\/ 손가락 하나에 관절 3개. 그중 가장 큰 오차를 대표값으로 쓴다.","    private func worstDegrees(_ finger: FingerName) -> CGFloat {","        guard let errors = model.currentMatch?.bendError,","              errors.count == PoseFeature.bendCount else { return 0 }","        let slice = errors[(finger.rawValue * 3)..<(finger.rawValue * 3 + 3)]","        return CGFloat((slice.max() ?? 0) * 180 \/ .pi)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"5.9","anchor":"59","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"40자 그리드에서 글자를 고르면 그 글자로 채점이 바뀝니다.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" 목표가 바뀌면 이전 글자의 판정 결과와 문장은 즉시 버려야 합니다. 남겨 두면 새 글자를 짚는 동안 이전 글자의 교정 문장이 잠깐 보입니다. 여기까지가 시뮬레이터에서 확인할 수 있는 전부입니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TutorModel.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — 목표가 바뀌면 판정을 비운다"}]},{"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"}],"code":["import ARKit","import Observation","import SwiftUI","","@MainActor","@Observable","final class TutorModel {","","    \/\/ 학습 목표","    var target: Jamo = .giyeok {","        didSet {","            stabilizer.reset()","            mockFeed.target = target","            currentMatch = nil","            advice = nil","            fingerNote = nil","        }","    }","    \/\/ …","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"실행 결과","anchor":"%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EA%B2%B0%EA%B3%BC"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"5단계를 마치면 나오는 화면","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"step5.jpg"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS 26.2 시뮬레이터에서 직접 캡처"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"체크포인트","anchor":"%EC%B2%B4%ED%81%AC%ED%8F%AC%EC%9D%B8%ED%8A%B8","type":"heading","level":3},{"text":"여기까지 하면","anchor":"%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%95%98%EB%A9%B4","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"자음 19 + 모음 21 = 40개 버튼이 보인다"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"글자를 바꾸면 판정 대상이 바뀐다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"헷갈리는 쌍 개수가 표시된다","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"‘ㅊ’을 고르면 약지·새끼 줄의 허용 오차선이 오른쪽으로 물러난다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"여기까지의 파일만으로 빌드가 통과한다"}]}]}]},{"level":4,"type":"heading","text":"안 되면 확인할 것","anchor":"%EC%95%88-%EB%90%98%EB%A9%B4-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%A0-%EA%B2%83"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"첫 렌더에서 모음 그리드가 비어 보일 수 있습니다. 한 번 클릭하면 정상으로 돌아옵니다 (LazyVGrid 레이아웃 타이밍)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"모든 글자가 같은 점수로 나오면 기준 표가 비어 있는 것입니다.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"허용 오차선이 모든 손가락에서 같은 자리라면 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"toleranceDegrees(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"가 아니라 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"model.toleranceDegrees"},{"type":"text","text":"를 그대로 쓰고 있는 것입니다."}]}]}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"계속하기","anchor":"%EA%B3%84%EC%86%8D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor","type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide","isActive":true}]}]}]}]}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"한 글자가 되면 나머지는 표를 채우는 일입니다. 다만 채우면서 무엇이 서로 헷갈리는지 기록해야 합니다.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"5. 40자로 늘린다"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://JihwaTutor/documentation/JihwaTutor/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"여기서부터는 Vision Pro가 필요합니다. 앞의 다섯 단계는 실기기 없이도 전부 돌아갑니다."}],"url":"\/documentation\/jihwatutor\/step-6-device-tracking-and-guide","title":"6. 실기기: 진짜 손과 3D 가이드"},"doc://JihwaTutor/documentation/JihwaTutor/Step-0-Project-Setup":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-0-Project-Setup","kind":"article"